	// X: `this` binds the compiler-carried current-object receiver.
	this:U8DWord;
	Book_read(u8_string_address("The Spell of Reveal~~This spell is a dissipation spell, meaning that it will actually dispell another type of magic, specifically the spell of invisibility. When the Theurgist casts this spell, a wave of energy moves away from the caster in ever increasing concentric circles. These energy waves will dispell all forms of invisibility. The Focus used for this spell is an open eye and the casting words are 'Ort Lor.'"), this);
