{
	// X: `this` binds the compiler-carried current-object receiver.
	this:U8DWord;
	Book_read(u8_string_address("The spell of Intervention~~A powerful spell, upon casting the spell of Intervention, the Theurgist calls into being a wall of Air that blocks all damaging forces. While this spell will protect the caster from all blows and striking attacks, it will not protect the caster from immersion in lava or drowning in Water. The Focus for this spell resembles a fist and the words used are 'In Sanct An Jux.'"), this);
